\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  MOF Watanabe After Suspected MOF  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 232 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Januar 2004\par 11:03\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--A top Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  official Wednesday wouldn't comment on whether \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monetary authorities \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market earlier in the day, but rejected the view that the MOF is spending too much to prop up the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 "As always, I can't comment on this matter," said Hiroshi Watanabe, head of the ministry's international division.  \par \par \uc2 Watanabe's remarks came after the dollar jumped nearly one yen to as high as Y106.65 in late Asian trade on what traders suspect was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  ordered by \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's MOF.  \par \par \uc2 A Tokyo brokerage dealer said a U.S. bank was detected placing huge dollar bids, likely on behalf of Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  authorities.  \par \par \uc2 The greenback soon lost ground and turned down to levels just above Y106.00, as Japanese exporters and non-Japanese speculators pounced on the opportunity to sell dollars.  \par \par \uc2 Watanabe said the ministry is only stepping into the market "when it's necessary."  \par \par \uc2 "We act when it's necessary to do so," Watanabe said. "I don't think (the amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is excessive."  \par \par \uc2 Fearing a sharp yen rise could snuff out Japan's economic recovery by hurting exports, the MOF sold over Y20 trillion, mostly for dollars, in market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  last year, and is said to have spent several trillions more so far in January.  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040128e01s000fb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
