\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  business lobby hopes for BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 .  \b0\par\par\uc2 232 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Januar 2004\par 09:40\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO, Jan 26 (Reuters) - The head of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's largest business lobby said on Monday that he hoped the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market if the dollar fell below 105 yen.  \par \par \uc2 "Most companies have said their assumed dollar/yen \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate is between 105 and 110 yen and their euro/yen rate is between 125 and 130 yen. If the market goes beyond these ranges, I expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Hiroshi Okuda, chairman of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  Business Federation (Keidanren) told a news conference.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar stood at 106.20 yen on Monday.  \par \par \uc2 Okuda said a strong euro against the yen had helped Japanese companies sell their products competitively in Europe and also helped offset losses incurred from the rise in the yen against the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 But the euro now appeared to be weakening against the yen, reversing the trend, he said.  \par \par \uc2 On Monday, the euro was trading at around 133 yen, after earlier this month rising above 137 yen. The euro/yen hit a record high of about 141 yen in late May last year.  \par \par \uc2 He said any further depreciation in the euro against the yen could hurt Japanese companies.  \par \par \uc2 "Further movements in the euro would create a tough situation for some Japanese companies," said Okuda, who is also chairman of Toyota Motor Corp.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040126e01q00231\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
