\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Mizoguchi says to act when  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  rates overshoot.  \b0\par\par\uc2 279 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Januar 2004\par 03:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO, Jan 22 (Reuters) - The Japanese authorities are ready to step in and take action if \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates overshoot, Japan's top financial diplomat said on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 "Dollar-selling based on the U.S. twin deficits as a factor is a speculative move that does not reflect real conditions and is inappropriate," Zembei Mizoguchi, vice finance minister for international affairs, told reporters.  \par \par \uc2 "When there is overshooting (in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates) we will take appropriate action," he said.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been suspected of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in recent weeks to curb a rise in its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which the authorities view as a threat to an export-led economic recovery.  \par \par \uc2 Mizoguchi sought to allay concerns over the United States' current account and fiscal deficits, seen as among the main reasons for the dollar's fall to record lows against the euro and three-year lows against the yen.  \par \par \uc2 Compared with the 1980s, when the United States also had so-called twin deficits, U.S. companies are now better positioned to mend the current account deficit, while the country's strong economy and tax-raising capacity should help its fiscal position, he said.  \par \par \uc2 "The thinking that the dollar must be weak just because of the twin deficits is a sort of stereotype," Mizoguchi said.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar was last trading at 106.89 yen up from a three-year low of 105.70 set last week.  \par \par \uc2 Against the backdrop of the dollar's broad-based decline, markets are on tenterhooks ahead of a Group of Seven meeting of finance ministers and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governors in Florida on February 6-7.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040122e01m000s0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
