\par\par \b \uc2 WRAP: BOJ Surprises With Easing In Face Of Rising Yen  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Iain McDonald  \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES  \par \uc2 980 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Januar 2004\par 10:04\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday eased monetary policy in a surprise move to maintain the country's economic revival and strengthen the fight against deflation, as the yen's recent rise threatens to knock the recovery off course.  \par \par \uc2 The Bank of Japan's nine-member board voted by a majority to boost the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's liquidity target under its quantitative easing policy by Y3 trillion to a new range of Y30 trillion to Y35 trillion.  \par \par \uc2 At the same time, the BOJ held steady its assessment that the economy will continue recovering at a moderate pace, indicating yen strength is the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's main target rather than an immediate economic slowdown.  \par \par \uc2 Analysts said the extra cash gives the BOJ more flexibility to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 's campaign against a sharp yen appreciation.  \par \par \uc2 Easier monetary policy may also placate other Group of Seven finance ministers and central bankers due to meet in Florida next month as it shows Japan is taking a number of steps to restore health to its economy, not just \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets.  \par \par \uc2 BOJ Governor Toshihiko Fukui said defeating deflation remains Japan's top priority and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could further ease policy even if the economic recovery proves stronger than it currently expects.  \par \par \uc2 He also warned that the yen's strength could undermine a recent improvement in confidence.  \par \par \uc2 "We don't think that one exchange market development poses an immediate downside risk to the economy," Fukui told reporters. "But if you consider how \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves impact people psychologically, it could develop into a downside risk."  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     BOJ Wants To Keep Working Closely With Govt \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Financial market participants weren't expecting an easing given recent data showing economic activity continues to accelerate. Economists also said extra cash washing through the financial system as a result of the easing will likely do little to lift economic activity.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "We believe any direct effect on the economy, apart from the 'announcement effect' will be limited," said Takuji Aida, senior economist at Merrill Lynch in Tokyo.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Indicating that some within the BOJ also view the easing as unwarranted, Fukui said two board members voted against the move as the economy is performing in line with expectations. Three board members opposed the BOJ's previous easing in October.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 In a monthly economic report released Tuesday, the BOJ left unchanged its assessment that the economy would recover gradually, ending a string of four consecutive upgrades of its view.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Persistent structural problems in Japan mean the pace of recovery will stay moderate and consumer prices will maintain a gradual decline, the BOJ said in announcing the policy easing.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "In the meantime, developments in financial and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets and their impact warrant close monitoring," the BOJ said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 While not specifically mentioning the yen's strength, that last sentence is a clear signal that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is targeting the yen in its latest policy action, analysts said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The easing is "to prevent the yen from rising and to support the MOF's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," said Masaaki Kanno, managing director of economic research at J.P. Morgan in Tokyo.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The yen has risen nearly 11% against the dollar since the beginning of last August. In response, Tokyo sold a record Y20.05 trillion in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  last year and is believed to have sold several trillion more this month.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A boost to liquidity indicates the BOJ wants to be seen as working in concert with the government, not only in halting the yen's rise, but also in defeating deflation. That's despite the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  indicating in the past that throwing more cash at the economy won't solve the structural problems.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The BOJ wants to show that it's on the same page as the government and that there's no rift between the two," says Koichi Ono, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  economist at Daiwa Institute of Research.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par      BOJ Eases ABS Buying Rules \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 By boosting the target for liquidity, which the BOJ measures through commercial banks' account balances at the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  can engage in more yen-selling \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  without having to drain yen from domestic money markets.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Selling yen in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market without offsetting that with draining \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  pushes up banks' account balances.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Fukui said the BOJ would aim to keep the current account balance at around Y33 trillion from around Y30 trillion before the easing.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Kanno said the BOJ, in its latest action, wants to take advantage of foreign investor perceptions that unsterilized \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is more effective than sterilized \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Despite the surprise, the easing had a limited impact on Tokyo's financial markets.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The dollar popped up to Y107.62 from around 107.50 just before the announcement, while 10-year JGB futures rose to 138.56 from 138.45. Stock prices held onto earlier gains.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 At 0815 GMT, the dollar was quoted at Y107.14, the lead JGB futures contract closed at 138.44, and the Nikkei 225 Stock Index ended 0.61% higher at 11103.10.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Separately, the BOJ board eased its rules for asset-backed securities buying \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , which the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  launched last year in an effort to make finance more readily available to smaller firms.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Market participants have said that the rules were too tight, and so far the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has bought only a limited amount of securities under the plan.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Looking ahead, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said it has brought forward by one day its next policy meeting to Feb. 4-5 from Feb. 5-6 to allow Fukui to attend the G7 meeting scheduled for Feb. 6-7.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Iain McDonald, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2941; iain.mcdonald@dowjones.com  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (Hiroshi Inoue, Michiyo Seki, Jonathan Soble and Miyako Takebe contributed to this article.)  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -Edited by Hugh Lawson  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040120e01k000am\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
